    "indoor",
    "outdoor"
   ],
   "text": "Paper: 10.3k trajectories, 260 tasks in 7 categories, 3M+ frames @30 Hz. HF release: 8,949 episodes, 246 tasks, 3,436,171 frames (~31.8 h); tactile G1 part: 4,064 episodes, 124 tasks, ~16.5 h"
  },
  "availability": "public",
  "access": "Hugging Face USC-PSI-Lab/humanoid-everyday, ungated, LeRobot v2.1, one parquet per episode (~935 GB, depth and LiDAR inside the parquet); tactile only in the G1 episodes of this full release, not in the lite G1/H1 repos.",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "caveats": [
   "Tactile only on G1 / Dex3-1 episodes (4,064); H1 / Inspire episodes have empty tactile arrays.",
   "In every sampled G1 episode only 22 of the 72 tactile cells vary; the others are a constant 30000 or NaN, and sensor 1 and the first value of sensor 2 contain odometry values (converter bug).",
   "Sensor-to-location mapping and units are not documented; values sit near 101 kPa and rise by at most a few hundred units during manipulation.",
   "The lite repos Humanoid-Everyday-G1/-H1 carry only joints, actions and video: no tactile, depth, LiDAR, IMU or odometry.",
   "meta/episodes.jsonl 'instruction' is the same string for all 8,949 episodes; use meta/tasks.jsonl via task_index.",
   "License differs between sources: HF card says Apache-2.0, GitHub README says MIT.",
   "Release (8,949 episodes, 246 tasks) is smaller than the paper's 10.3k / 260; 5 episodes were dropped for zero valid frames."
  ],
